STUDENT CASHLESS ACCOUNTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Setup flow:
1. Admin creates account in Admin → Students → New Account
   OR student self-registers at /student/register → admin activates it
2. Admin tops up balance (student hands cash to admin → admin credits account)
3. Admin loads QR → prints card → hands to student with temp PIN
   Temp PIN = last 4 digits of student ID number
4. Student logs into /student with ID number + temp PIN
5. Student forced to change PIN before accessing dashboard
6. Student pays at kiosk: Cashless → scan QR card → enter 4-digit PIN → done

Student ID rules:
  7 digits = student account
  6 digits = faculty account
  Any other length → rejected at both client and server

PIN rules:
  Always exactly 4 digits everywhere (login, payment, change-pin)
  Stored as bcrypt hash — never retrievable, only resettable

Admin account actions:
  Activate / Freeze / Unfreeze / Reset PIN / Regenerate QR / Edit Details / Delete
  Delete requires balance = ₱0 first (prevents accidental loss of funds)

